# Storm, Windrider: "those creatures" are the objects the spell targeted when it was cast, the trigger event; a later change of
# targets (CR 115.7) is a separate event and changes none of them. Bot1's Giant Growth targets Bot2's Grizzly Bears and
# Storm's trigger goes on the stack; Bot2 answers with Bolt Bend (full cost: no power-4 creature, Black Lotus makes up the
# mana) and changes the Growth's target to Memnite. The Bears gain flying; the Memnite, which the Growth now pumps to 4/4,
# does not.

